## 5. Goals & Success Metrics

### Product objectives (from spec, retained)
- Enable users to maintain daily journal entries.
- Analyze emotions using AI.
- Track mood trends over time.
- Generate personalized wellness suggestions.
- Promote self-awareness and emotional reflection.

### Suggested success metrics (not in original spec — recommended additions)
| Metric | Target signal |
|---|---|
| Activation rate | % of registered users who create ≥1 journal entry within 24 hours. |
| Retention | % of users who log an entry in ≥3 distinct weeks within their first month. |
| Engagement depth | Average entries per active user per week. |
| AI reliability | % of `/api/analyze/{id}/` calls that return a valid, parseable emotion/mood/suggestion payload. |
| Latency | p95 time from entry submission to analysis result returned. |
| Perceived value (qualitative) | User feedback / survey on whether wellness suggestions feel relevant. |

