## 7. User Stories (illustrative, derived from MVP features)

- *As a new user*, I want to register and log in securely, so that my journal stays private to me.
- *As a returning user*, I want to write a journal entry and immediately see my detected mood and a suggestion, so journaling feels responsive rather than passive.
- *As a user reflecting on my week*, I want to see a mood history graph, so I can notice patterns (e.g., Mondays are consistently low-mood).
- *As a user who's been inconsistent*, I want a weekly summary even if I only wrote 2–3 entries, so I still get value from partial use.
- *As a privacy-conscious user*, I want to know what happens to my journal text before I write anything sensitive.

