## 8. Technical Context (for reference — not a PRD requirement, summarized from spec)

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| Backend | Django REST Framework |
| Database | Supabase PostgreSQL |
| Auth | Supabase Auth |
| AI | Gemini API (Gemini 1.5/2.0) |
| API Docs | Swagger / drf-spectacular |
| Deployment | Render |
| VCS | Git & GitHub |

**Flow:** User → Django REST API → Supabase PostgreSQL → Gemini API → Emotion Analysis → Saved to DB → Returned to User.

Key entities: `Users`, `Journal Entries`, `Emotion Analysis` (1 entry → 1 analysis record, linked by foreign key). Full field-level schema is defined in the source spec (Section 9) and should be treated as the engineering source of truth alongside this PRD.

